    },
    {
      "id": "JzANxmrtEsioswS8z599F",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4067.43,
      "y": 1160.34,
      "text": "Went to Parsons School of Design\nRated #1 in the country.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "cEBCm_ekegAXvpKpapCVD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3987.14,
      "y": 1330.84,
      "text": "Started in graphic design, video editing,\nillustration, animation, 3D modeling, etc.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "Sjnp7ThNXK67RK45WTIbz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3963.09,
      "y": 1480.89,
      "text": "Started in graphic design, video editing,\nillustration, animation, 3D modeling, etc.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "rhh9dTR_NlUZvXpHlQ1EE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4775.3,
      "y": 1612.71,
      "text": "Transferred to Depaul CDM\nto study engineering proper.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "MdlMWA3D6DOTNcCodeQDx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4748.37,
      "y": 1990.55,
      "text": "Also important... I gew up in the business side of this pursuit.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "0TwflYu5Htid1HdUNyZ8h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4803.74,
      "y": 2404.66,
      "text": "A lot of my early dinner table conversations were around business,\ntech, employee contracts, failure, ROI, etc. etc. and that got the\nindustry in me from a very early age. It is a lifestyle.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "4_hHHtCUjBZVevlQ4uBBY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4428.54,
      "y": 1598.32,
      "text": "It's a good question.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "3e8ZVPLafXpa5h2bvbWGc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5556.2,
      "y": 1334.11,
      "text": "Got scouted my last year in a \nwell known youtubers private Discord",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "ljjBrC1t2WQtuNZyMv-HD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5551.05,
      "y": 1456.76,
      "text": "Righthub Employee #3 -> Acquisition",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "30-dFGfvCQE549J8AY-0K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5516.94,
      "y": 1501.61,
      "text": "Axiom Employee #22 Series A",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "VK8NOLdCZfhEjKA9Kc9WE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5493.01,
      "y": 1548.68,
      "text": "ComfyUI #26 Series A-B",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "qWeSJb1FLbd4BafoeAJp9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5542.27,
      "y": 1186.92,
      "text": "Have always had the mentality that\nstartups are more fun... more intense...\nbut more fun!",
