    {
      "id": "grqvEeK7Xgj24_Zrujm5G",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7163.11,
      "y": 1366.21,
      "text": "Now you know how I define the role. You know I am posed for the job. Now let's talk about you.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "FvOcwMLHyk8_8csSAbpnJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11558.11,
      "y": 1572.62,
      "text": "If this felt compelling to you and if you need someone with my expertise, let's connect!",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "Q0KCFfzNdR_BWNm_KyA7n",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 7131.55,
      "y": 1491.7,
      "src": "/canvas/excalidraw/Q0KCFfzNdR_BWNm_KyA7n.svg",
      "width": 1220.11,
      "height": 48,
      "variant": "bare"
    },
    {
      "id": "KbsEw_LUnCeS8C-rb0NXN",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 11542.29,
      "y": 1484.62,
      "src": "/canvas/excalidraw/KbsEw_LUnCeS8C-rb0NXN.svg",
      "width": 1220.11,
      "height": 48,
      "variant": "bare"
    },
    {
      "id": "v6vU_rlVEe2i-Y10mwjKm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7125.81,
      "y": 1627.04,
      "text": "Let's take a brief look into my past work for a sec.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "K6hxAP7HGQMXoZupqCLQf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9355.93,
      "y": 941.69,
      "text": "If you or anyone you know meets this criteria hmu.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "K_VJg6bc9vegyyKlHm2B2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9356.08,
      "y": 888.28,
      "text": "Who I want to work with.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "lwjfUe9hsbehWmbYn9zH8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12958.21,
      "y": 1346.08,
      "text": "Connect with me on socials, or drop me an email.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "OPTO5NiEl-agR6kYWRSiO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8739.05,
      "y": 1435.16,
      "text": "Not all products should make their product quality\npart of their moat.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "zv5_PHRU1QQwu1P6-MdDk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9409.43,
      "y": 1508.57,
      "text": "Being ambitious for the sake of being\nambitious is just treading water...",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "KqcdYdGXsCkPuOSx2uUNf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10078.43,
      "y": 1410.75,
      "text": "I love LLMs and I use them to generate a lot of things.\nIncluding code, images, plain text etc.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "FlpWojqnuaY41V3zdZTUw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10072.46,
      "y": 1474.88,
      "text": "But... I am also an engineer.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "YmPcRLvSV-IkCd1kA12e2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10064.85,
      "y": 1510.75,
      "text": "and... an actual deisgner.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "2auk3RZj5zeDo6xwzp-n_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10073.54,
      "y": 1577.05,
      "text": "Let's focus more on what it is we are shipping and less about\nhow we built it please.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "wI4igcLrYLlZOLiG-1AIf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9432.61,
      "y": 1581.02,
      "text": "I am huge believer of beating the averages.\n(Don't know what that entails? DM me.)",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "1ew2oKhf5SZJ1jrcoAXOr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8745.92,
      "y": 1501.72,
      "text": "Product quality is less about the product itself and more of a\ntranslation of care for the users.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "BazyIEcB-GHurZOJIf8MO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8759.93,
      "y": 1575.15,
      "text": "If you are truly talking to customers, and truly want to offer delight,\ndesign and quality are table stakes.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "kByKUvZIC3VXcEohlfnft",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8766.72,
      "y": 2110.32,
      "text": "In this era, time to market is important.\nBut also making coherent decisions is important.\nThat comes with experience.",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "vfzQSJrH8DB1MVdKQ4cv0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9831.66,
      "y": 2075.42,
      "text": "Everyone needs a little something different.\nI thrive in transparency. The more is shared,\nthe more I can better decisions.",
